{'symbol': 'DOV', 'date': '2022-10-24 16:15:00', 'title': 'MARKEM-IMAJE LAUNCHES NEW SUITE OF CONNECTED PRINTER SERVICES POWERED BY INTERNET OF THINGS PLATFORM', 'text': 'DOWNERS GROVE, ILL. , OCT. 24, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- MARKEM-IMAJE, PART OF DOVER (NYSE: DOV) AND A GLOBAL PROVIDER OF END-TO-END SUPPLY CHAIN SOLUTIONS AND INDUSTRIAL MARKING AND CODING SYSTEMS, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF ITS MIVISTA™ CONNECTED PRINTER SERVICES DESIGNED TO STREAMLINE AND IMPROVE DAILY CODING OPERATIONS ACROSS THE PRINTER FLEET.'}